    "chunk_id": "chunk_3",
    "source": "inventory_rules.md",
    "title": "3. Zero-Sales Handling & Demand Assumptions",
    "text": "Document: inventory_rules.md\nSection: 3. Zero-Sales Handling & Demand Assumptions\n- When `current_stock == 0` and `avg_daily_sales == 0`: `stock_coverage_days = 0.0`, status is `OUT_OF_STOCK`.\n- When `current_stock > 0` and `avg_daily_sales == 0`: `stock_coverage_days = float('inf')` (Infinity), status is `SLOW_MOVING` if stock >= 15.\n- Demand velocity is calculated over a rolling 30-day window unless otherwise specified.",
